{"strongs": "H6187", "word": "עֵ֫רֶךְ", "translit": "e.rekh", "root": "ערב", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "order, row, estimate", "definition": "עֵ֫רֶךְ 33 noun masculine Lev 27:25 order, row, estimate — construct ׳ ע Judg 17:10 ; Exod 40:23 suffix עֶרְכִּי Ps 55:14 , עֶרְכְּךָ Lev 5:15 +, etc.; — 1. order, row , בְּגָדִים ׳ ע Judg 17:10 a (complete) suit of clothes (laid out in order), ᵐ5 B στολὴν ἱματίων ; לֶחֶם ׳ ע Exod 40:23 i.e. loaves arranged in a row, so ׳ ע alone v Exod 40:4 ( P ); עֶרְכּוֺ Job 41:4 his symmetry (see חִין below חנן ). 2. estimate, valuation , made by ordering, classifying: אִישׁ כְּעֶרְכּוֺ 2Kgs 23:35 in 2Kgs 12:5 read עֵרֶךְ (for ᵑ0 עוֺנֵּר ) money of a man's valuation ᵐ5 Benz Kit , and probably strike out כֶּסֶף נַפְשׁוֺת עֶרְכּוֺ (? ׳ עֶרֶח נ ׳ כ Kit ) as gloss ( Sta ZAW v (1885), 288 f. ); כְּעֶרְכִּי Ps 55:14 a man according to my valuation , figurative for my equal ; elsewhere P , of priest's valuation of trespass-offering Lev 5:15 ; Lev 5:18 ; Lev 5:25 , vows, and redemption-money Lev 27:2 ; Lev 27:3 (twice in verse); Lev 27:4 + 17 t. 27 ( כֶּסֶף עֶרְכְּךָ see 15; v Lev 27:19 , מִכְסַת הָעֶרְכְּךָ v Lev 27:23 [strike out ךְָ ], compare v Lev 27:23 b [strike out id. ]), Num 18:16 . — Job 28:13 read דַּרְכָּהּ ᵐ5 Di and others", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6382')\">BDB6382</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6187')\">H6187</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6381')\">BDB6381</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6383')\">BDB6383</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֵ֫רֶךְ</bdbheb><sub>33</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Lev 27:25\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(3,27,25)\">Lev 27:25</ref></sup> <highlightword>order, row, estimate</highlightword> — construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 17:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,17,10)\">Judg 17